.TH "JOURNAL COMMAND"
The journal command prints out either the latest edition of the
"Fast Food Journal" or all the editions since the game began.
.s3
The form of the command is:
.EX journal [ all ]
.s3
If the argument "all" is included on the command line all the editions
will be printed, one after another.
.s3
The Fast Food Journal contains reports on stock transactions and
exchanges, advertisements, name changes, etc.
.s3
A typical output looks like:
.NF
[17h] ::: journal
